<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Half Awake</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #000;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
      padding: 3em;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 1.25em;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .line {
      margin-bottom: 2em;
      opacity: 0.88;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="line">i’m not sad, just tired a lot</div>
  <div class="line">kinda miss you, kinda not</div>
  <div class="line">tried deleting every sign,<br>but the ghost still hits on time</div>
  <div class="line">you said nothing, and i felt that</div>
  <div class="line">left your mess and called it growth</div>
  <div class="line">fake hope and empty rooms</div>
  <div class="line">i know i’ve got fake closure</div>
  <div class="line">this isn’t about closure.<br>it’s about everything that lingers</div>
</body>
</html>
